  "description": "It’s hard for omegas to find jobs, but Song Hayoon does the best he can. He spends all his time on part-time jobs just so he can pay back his father’s debts. It’s not easy, but he makes it work… but sometimes he wonders if there ever will be an escape out of this never-ending vicious cycle of a life. Then one day, he comes to learn that the prestigious Taewon Group has taken over all his debts. And none other than the Executive Vice President, Kang Hyun-tae, comes to offer him a job… as his personal boytoy. Will this put an end to Hayoon’s troubles, or will it be the start of his new misery? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes 12 extra chapters.*",
